### ISSUE 1 — Skeleton crashes or shows nothing (Next.js SSR + TensorFlow.js)

**Problem:** TensorFlow.js WebGL backend cannot run during server-side rendering. Imports at module level crash the server.

**Solution:** Make all TensorFlow imports dynamic and lazy — only run inside async functions called client-side.

